{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49254","headline":"河传 一 · 温庭筠","name":"河传 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江畔，相唤。\n晓妆鲜，仙景个女采莲。\n请君莫向那岸边，少年，好花新满船。\n红袖摇曳逐风輭，垂玉腕，肠向柳丝断。\n浦南归，浦北归，莫知，晚来人已稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}